e la cible."},{"id":14681,"name":"Ronda","element":"earth","is_variant":true,"image_url":"/data/spells/img/sort_12446-48.png","levels":[{"grade":1,"ap":4,"minRange":0,"maxRange":1,"maxPerTurn":1,"critChance":15,"effects":[{"element":"earth","min":38,"max":42,"kind":"damage"}],"critEffects":[{"element":"earth","min":46,"max":50,"kind":"damage"}],"buffs":["Attire de 2 case"]}],"description":"Occasionne des dommages Terre aux ennemis et attire les cibles vers le lanceur en zone."},{"id":13402,"name":"Fougue","element":"neutral","is_variant":false,"image_url":"/data/spells/img/sort_12412-48.png","levels":[{"grade":1,"ap":2,"minRange":0,"maxRange":5,"maxPerTurn":0,"critChance":0,"effects":[]},{"grade":2,"ap":2,"minRange":0,"maxRange":6,"maxPerTurn":0,"critChance":0,"effects":[]}],"description":"Rend l'allié ciblé Intaclable ou l'ennemi ciblé Insoignable."},{"id":13404,"name":"Mascarade","element":"neutral","is_variant":true,"image_url":"/data/spells/img/sort_12441-48.png","levels":[{"grade":1,"ap":3,"minRange":1,"maxRange":1,"maxPerTurn":0,"critChance":0,"effects":[{"element":"neutral","min":25,"max":0,"kind":"damage"},{"element":"neutral","min":25,"max":0,"kind":"damage"},{"element":"neutral","min":25,"max":0,"kind":"damage"},{"element":"neutral","min":25,"max":0,"kind":"damage"}]}],"description":"Occasionne des dommages Neutre au lanceur et à la cible :\n• Les dommages sur la cible dépendent de la vie restante du lanceur.\n• Les dommages sur le lanceur dépendent de sa vie manquante.\n• Les effets sont permutés si le lanceur est à moins de 50% de sa vie.\n\nSur le lanceur : échange de position avec son Masque Grimaçant."},{"id":13399,"name":"Transe","element":"neutral","is_variant":false,"image_url":"/data/spells/img/sort_12416-48.png","levels":[{"grade":1,"ap":3,"minRange":0,"maxRange":1,"maxPerTurn":0,"critChance":25,"effects":[],"buffs":["-75% PV (2T)","Bouclier : 450% du niveau (2T)","Bouclier : 225% du niveau (2T)"]},{"grade":2,"ap":3,"minRange":0,"maxRange":1,"max